  "description": "The world is full of surprising customs, traditions, and ways of life!\n\nAmazing World Cultures: True or False Quiz is a casual quiz game where you can learn about greetings, food, festivals, manners, and everyday culture from countries around the globe through simple true-or-false questions.\n\nIs it true? Or is it false?\nAs you play, you will uncover fun facts and fascinating cultural differences from around the world.\n\nPerfect for trivia fans, curious learners, and players who want to have fun while discovering something new.\n\nEnjoy a quiz adventure packed with surprises, knowledge, and global culture!",
